{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Fix pushed as Gerrit change 2642 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2642), commit f71ddff402ea.\n\nRED evidence (before the fix), driving the real `Makefile` in a sandbox with `make venv` stubbed to exit 1:\n\n```\n→ git fetch origin\n→ git worktree add /tmp/.../wt -b demo origin/main\n→ provisioning /tmp/.../wt/.venv (pinned Python) then canonical 'make install'\n\n✓ worktree ready: /tmp/.../wt\n  activate it with:  cd /tmp/.../wt && source .venv/bin/activate\nEXIT=0\n```\n\n`make install` was never invoked (the delegation log recorded only `venv`), yet the target announced success and exited 0.\n\nThe new `tests/unit/test_makefile_worktree.py` was seen RED first: 4 failed / 1 passed (the surviving pass is the happy path, held as the guard against an \"always fail\" fix). After the `Makefile` change: 5 passed, and 12 passed together with `test_worktree_python_pin.py`.\n\nRoot cause confirmed as described in the plan: the recipe's steps were `;`-joined on one shell line and make checks only the line's overall status (its last command, an `echo`). Fixed with `set -e` plus per-step `|| { echo \"ERROR: …\"; exit 1; }` handlers naming the failed step; the provisioning handler also states the worktree exists but is unprovisioned and gives both the finish and the remove command.\n\nGates: `make lint` exit 0 (includes the complexity, mechanism-delta and repo hygiene ratchets), `make typecheck` exit 0. Per the operator's load constraint (the Gerrit host had a 41-minute IOPS outage tonight), the full local suite was deliberately NOT run; CI's `Verified` vote is the authoritative full-suite result.\n\nNot closing: awaiting `LLM-Review +1` and `Verified +1` on change 2642."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788561532140783851,"uuid":"03ac495d-75b7-48fa-a4f0-29654576a9cb"}